      "sourceTextSha256": "d6eea7720151fead01b8fc29a840028c49da61b8c35f91021cd17127e2d649f8",
      "text": "Day 8 · A jungle walk with a naturalist guide and a visit to a caboclo house, to discover local daily life and the secrets of making manioc flour. After lunch, a visit to the village of Acajatuba, where people live from fishing and farming and local artisans make crafts from natural seeds. Then a canoe trip into the igapó, the flooded forest, and piranha fishing; after dinner, a torch-lit walk along the riverbanks to spot caimans and, with luck, nightjars, snakes and frogs.",
